  78:../build/CMakeFiles/4.1.0-rc4/CompilerIdC/CMakeCCompilerId.c **** /* __INTEL_LLVM_COMPILER = VVVVRP prior to 2021.2.0, VVVVRRPP for 2021.2.0 and
  79:../build/CMakeFiles/4.1.0-rc4/CompilerIdC/CMakeCCompilerId.c ****  * later.  Look for 6 digit vs. 8 digit version number to decide encoding.
